{
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "annotation": "Aligned with tutorial.md: corrected gene-filter order, added Inspect AnnData checkpoints after filtering steps 2/4/6, added regress_out(total_counts) and a second PCA/PCA QC plot, and rewired neighbours to PCA after regression.\nCellTypist fix: normalization is performed by pp.normalize_total(target_sum=10000) followed by pp.log1p. The pp.regress_out branch is retained only for PCA comparison, because regression replaces .X with residuals that CellTypist rejects. Neighbors and all downstream clustering/spatial/CellTypist/LIANA steps now branch from the PCA computed on normalized log1p expression, preserving valid .X.\n\nWorkflow output labels and dataset rename actions were normalised to unique, human-readable names for GTN workflow testing and Zenodo expected outputs. Large spatialdata.zip intermediates/final objects are intentionally not exposed as test outputs. Analytical tool order, parameters, and connections are unchanged.",
